{
 "_doc": "Expected actions for gate-triage. node company/tools/decide.js test gate-triage [--all] (exit 1 on a miss). A case's `versions` names the versions it is for: v1 takes plain facts on the caller's word (replay only); v2 facts are {value, source} and a safety fact from the actor counts as absent. `actor` is the acting seat. Cases see the closed param defaults (maxSpendUsd 0) unless they set params.",
